# Used only by `docker build -f container/release-tools.Dockerfile .`. Allow only
# the release-tools programs and SQL, plus the Cloudflare entrypoint package and
# its materializer, which only the `cloudflare` target copies.
*
!release_tools/**
!deploy/cloudflare/sentrysearch_cloudflare/**
!dev/prepare_service_volumes.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
